abstract: >-
  Canonical public research archive for Richard J. Reyes, containing citation
  metadata and public research records spanning Wave Confinement Theory,
  resonance and nonlinear-wave research, computational physics, WaveLock,
  persistent wave memory, and recursive AI drift. Individual research outputs
  should be cited using the specific Zenodo release used rather than the archive
  landing page alone.
